{"_type":"issue","id":"variation-audit-z3x.22","title":"ADR: Hybrid architecture - reuse engine + new product layer + Beads orchestration","description":"DECISION (2026-06-27): Hybrid architecture. REUSE the existing AI detection engine from the prior changeorder-recovery project (proven on synthetic data: ingest/baseline/classify/quantify/confidence pipeline). BUILD a new product layer on top (auth, orgs, project upload, multi-source ingestion, commercial review workflow, reporting, dashboard). Use Beads for workflow tracking and orchestration. Rationale: avoid rebuilding a validated engine; focus new effort on product/UX, ingestion, and review/reporting. Implication: tasks .9-.13 are ADAPT/INTEGRATE work, not greenfield; new task .21 owns the port + engine/product API contract.","status":"open","priority":0,"issue_type":"decision","owner":"oualidmenadjelia@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-06-27T01:00:02Z","created_by":"Oualid Menadjelia","updated_at":"2026-06-27T01:00:02Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"variation-audit-z3x.22","depends_on_id":"variation-audit-z3x","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-06-27T02:00:02Z","created_by":"Oualid Menadjelia","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
